abstract: >-
  Code, data and results for a conformance study of Cognitive Complexity
  implementations: 11 open-source implementations compared with SonarQube's
  analyzers for Python, Java, JavaScript/TypeScript and Go on a
  specification-derived micro-corpus of 270 functions and on 138,393 leaf root
  functions from 32 pinned open-source repositories.
keywords:
  - cognitive complexity
  - software metrics
  - static analysis
  - conformance testing
  - differential testing
  - SonarQube
  - reproducibility
